{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222340","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322234001:1":{"text":"어젯밤 장원 북쪽에서 고블린의 울음소리가 들렸어요. 평소와는 다르게 매우 불안하고 부정적인 감정이 느껴졌어요.","source_cn":"昨夜我在庄园北部听到了咕布林的叫声，那情绪与以往不同，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16E7E5597DD4CB59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322234002:1":{"text":"아마도 놀라거나 무언가 곤란한 일이 있는 것 같아요.","source_cn":"也许他们被惊扰到了，也许正被什么困扰着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF94CF4C2CBA718B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322234003:1":{"text":"살아있는 시체와 마찰이 생기지 않도록 확인해주실 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"我害怕他们因此与活死人发生冲突，可以拜托你前去看看吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF4D642600136AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}